{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-eleve","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"gate-eleven-amwaj-development-mbr-city","about":"Nestled within the vibrant MBR City District 11, Gate Eleven presents a refined residential community that perfectly balances modern luxury and everyday convenience. Developed by AMWAJ Development, this distinguished project features four residential buildings offering elegant 1 and 2-bedroom apartments. Designed for urban professionals and families alike, the development integrates well-appointed living spaces with a suite of lifestyle-enhancing amenities.Residents of Gate Eleven Residences at MBR City will enjoy access to swimming pools, fully equipped gyms, a dedicated boxing studio, and a serene yoga studio. Additional conveniences include retail outlets for daily essentials and a kids' play area. What truly sets this project apart are its open, uninterrupted views over the surrounding park, lagoon, and upscale villa communities—an inspiring backdrop to everyday life.","price":1200000,"title":"Gate Eleven","bitrix":{"id":1229,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Gate Eleven","tower_name":"Gate Eleven Residences","campaign_name":"Gate Eleven","property_type":"Apartments","developer_name":"Amwaj Development","project_location":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gate_Eleven_by_AMWAJ_in_MBR_City_District_11_65eeb81af3.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gate_Eleven_by_AMWAJ_in_MBR_City_District_11_65eeb81af3.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0474505,"lng":55.2074301},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Gate_Eleven_by_AMWAJ_in_MBR_City_District_11_a6eb60f06b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Gate_Eleven_by_AMWAJ_in_MBR_City_District_11_a6eb60f06b.webp"},{"340x252":